  "description": "dotConnect for Google BigQuery is an ADO.NET provider for working with Google BigQuery data through the standard ADO.NET interfaces. It allows you to easily integrate BigQuery data into your .NET applications, and integrate BigQuery with widely used data-oriented technologies.\n\nThe provider works with .NET Frameworks 4.6.1+, .NET Core 2.0+, .NET 5+.\n\nIt has the same standard ADO.NET classes as other standard ADO.NET providers: BigQueryConnection, BigQueryCommand, BigQueryDataAdapter, BigQueryDataReader, BigQueryParameter, etc. This allows you quickly get started with it and eliminates the need to study any BigQuery API specificities.\n\nMore information at https://www.devart.com/dotconnect/bigquery/\n\nLicense\n\nSee pricing options for ordering https://www.devart.com/dotconnect/bigquery/ordering.html\n\nThe NuGet package initiates the retrieval of an activation key from the Devart website. This key is required to activate the product for a free trial.\n\nKey Features\n\n* Easy Connection: Allows your .NET application to work with BigQuery data using a user account, a service account or interactive OAuth.\n* SQL Access: Query BigQuery with familiar GoogleSQL statements instead of calling the BigQuery REST API.\n* Support and updates: Enjoy dedicated support team for prompt issue resolution and regular updates to keep your software running smoothly and securely.",
